00:05:27,272 --> 00:05:33,272
It's the end of the world as we know it.

2
00:10:54,545 --> 00:11:00,545
Greenland is a action, adventure, thriller film directed by Ric Roman Waugh.

3
00:16:21,818 --> 00:16:27,818
John Garrity, his estranged wife and their young son embark on a perilous journey
to find sanctuary as a planet-killing comet hurtles toward Earth.

4
00:21:49,090 --> 00:21:55,090
Amid terrifying accounts of cities getting levelled, the
Garritys experience the best and worst in humanity.

5
00:27:16,363 --> 00:27:22,363
As the countdown to the global apocalypse approaches zero, their incredible trek
culminates in a desperate and last-minute flight to a possible safe haven.

6
